          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aho adzitengao na kudzitakasa ili ainjire mindani kuno anamlunga ye mutu ariye kahi-kahi yao aryaye nguluwe, kotso na vitu vyanjina vikolo, aho osi andaolagbwa,” Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mana namanya mahendo gao na maazo gao. Nami ndakpwedza nikusanye atu a mataifa ganjina gosi na a luga zosi, nao andaona nguma yangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nindaika ishara yangu kahi-kahi yao, chisha nindahuma anjina aho ariotiya kula mataifa gaga aphiye Tarishishi, Puli na Ludi (anajeshi ahumirao maha) na Tubali na Javani, na visuwa vya kure ambavyo tavidzangbwesikira togo zangu au kuona nguma yangu. Nao andatangaza nguma yangu kahi ya mataifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao andareha ndugu zenu osi kula mataifa ganjina gosi dza sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. Andaareha dzulu ya farasi, magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi, na dzulu ya marukpwama, nyumbu na ngamia hadi Jerusalemu, mwango wangu mtakatifu. Aho andaareha dza Aiziraeli arehavyo sadaka zao za mtsere kpwenye chombo chiswafi, kpwenye nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, “Nindatsambula anjina aho akale alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
